# Node
node_modules/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Agent eval fixtures are deliberately local-only.
# tests/<agent>/expected-findings.md is the answer key for that agent's eval:
# publishing it contaminates the benchmark, since anything trained on this repo
# has already seen the expected output. The eval TOOLING (scripts/eval/) is public;
# the fixtures are not. tests/_verify/ is the verifier's own self-test and stays public.
tests/*
!tests/README.md
!tests/_verify
